OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FNew Liverpool loan signing Ronald
OL,7,FAraujo says he's eager to learn from
OL,8,Fcaptain Virgil van Dijk as he begins
OL,9,Fhis Anfield career.
OL,11,FAraujo described the Dutchman as a
OL,12,F"role model" and "reference point"
OL,13,Fboth on and off the pitch.
OL,15,FThe 27-year-old Uruguay international
OL,16,Fcentre-back has taken a pay cut to
OL,17,Fjoin Liverpool, with the club holding
OL,18,Fan option to make the deal permanent
OL,19,Ffor a pre-agreed fee believed to be
OL,20,Faround #47 million from Barcelona.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@LO]tD@ROUtD@bO]
