PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FAraujo said the opportunity to play
OL,7,Falongside Van Dijk, widely regarded as
OL,8,Fone of the world's best defenders, was
OL,9,Fa huge factor in his decision.
OL,11,FAraujo told Liverpool's website. "We
OL,12,Fall know what a great player Virgil is
OL,14,F"He's a real reference point for the
OL,15,Fteam and a role model for me
OL,16,Fpersonally as well.
OL,26,@sD@bOUvD@AOU
