PN,36803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,F"I'm excited to have the chance to
OL,7,Flearn from him and play alongside him.
OL,8,FWith hard work, I think we can achieve
OL,9,Fgreat things together as a partnership
OL,10,Fand as a defence."
OL,12,FLiverpool moved to strengthen their
OL,13,Fback line after Ibrahima Konate's
OL,14,Fdeparture and ongoing injury problems
OL,15,Fat right-back left them short of
OL,16,Foptions.
OL,26,@rD@RO]
