PN,36804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FThe club values Araujo's experience,
OL,7,Fhe was named Barcelona captain in
OL,8,FJanuary, and his fitness, having
OL,9,Falready completed pre-season training
OL,10,Fwith the Spanish side. He is expected
OL,11,Fto join full squad training later this
OL,12,Fweek.
OL,14,FAraujo, who has won three league
OL,15,Ftitles and two Copas del Rey with
OL,16,FBarcelona, is clear about his
OL,17,Fambitions at Liverpool.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
