FL,369,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FHe said: "Without a shadow of a doubt,
OL,7,Fthe aim is to win trophies. Liverpool
OL,8,Fis a club competing for everything, so
OL,9,Fwe need to be battling on all fronts.
OL,11,F"You aim high at a club like this, and
OL,12,FI'll be giving everything I have to
OL,13,Fhelp us succeed."
OL,15,FHe has already received good luck
OL,16,Fmessages from former Liverpool
OL,17,FUruguayans Luis Suarez and Darwin
OL,18,FNunez.
OL,26,@nD@JOUuD@QO]
