PN,36806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FThe arrival of Araujo gives new head
OL,7,Fcoach Andoni Iraola greater defensive
OL,8,Fdepth, with Jeremy Jacquet set to
OL,9,Freturn from a knee injury and Giovanni
OL,10,FLeoni nearing the end of his ACL rehab.
OL,12,FYoungsters Ifeanyi Ndukwe and Mor
OL,13,FNdiaye, both 18, have impressed in pre-
OL,14,Fseason, but with Joe Gomez out for the
OL,15,Fstart of the campaign, Iraola needed
OL,16,Fanother senior option after last
OL,17,Fseason's reliance on Van Dijk and
OL,18,FKonate.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
