PN,36807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F368A1787615680
OL,3,CNew Liverpool loan signing excited to
OL,4,Cplay alongside 'Role model' Van Djik
OL,6,FLiverpool are still actively searching
OL,7,Ffor further reinforcements,
OL,8,Fparticularly in attack.
OL,10,FWhile they retain interest in Paris St
OL,11,FGermain's Bradley Barcola, the club
OL,12,Fremains committed to its self-
OL,13,Fsustaining model and will not overpay
OL,14,Ffor any target.
OL,16,FAraujo's loan move, which has no
OL,17,Fimmediate transfer fee, ensures
OL,18,FLiverpool can continue to strengthen
OL,19,Felsewhere without stretching the
OL,20,Fbudget.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/8
